{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_038chz_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_038chz_4001_038chz", "source_sha256": "ecaa870bd1011a790b78fa189bf206b107054a53fd9912470d6008e0010b753c", "ja": "……大丈夫、大丈夫ですわ。\n真のセレブは、些細なことには動じないもの……。", "zh": "……没事的，没事的。\n真正的名流不会为这点小事就慌了手脚……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_038chz_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_038chz_4002_p", "source_sha256": "87466eb82dbe68ec2a2d46c95bbcfc5750f59326589342b98823abe46fda1445", "ja": "千鶴さん……もしかして、緊張してますか？", "zh": "千鹤……你该不会在紧张吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_038chz_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_038chz_4003_038chz", "source_sha256": "de186ad69fde769485a0b8eb60dda06dee79f0bbb938e6d8ceeecede7e7aad5e", "ja": "ききき、緊張なんてしていませんわ！　わたくしが、\n商店街のライブくらいでうろたえるなど……！", "zh": "才才才、才不会紧张呢！本小姐才不会因为\n在商店街举行演唱会这种小事惊慌失措……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_038chz_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_038chz_4004_038chz", "source_sha256": "798e8547be727786345cc03c963bfa01350a4baaf568a09937e85ee95a0db1e8", "ja": "ただ、この会場は、わたくしの実家……ゴホッ、\n自宅に近いものですから。", "zh": "只是这个会场离本小姐的老家……咳咳，\n离本小姐的住处很近。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_038chz_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_038chz_4005_038chz", "source_sha256": "e2e53f468b3f0eebe2510a004c62eedb8135b3a2502546b4a0bda04c47ddf3f6", "ja": "わたくしをよく知る人が、偶然、通りかかったら……\nと思うと、少し落ち着かなかっただけですわ。", "zh": "要是有熟识本小姐的人碰巧经过的话……\n想到这点，就感到有些浮躁而已。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_038chz_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_038chz_4006_p", "source_sha256": "5174191a3bf272be5d342105585c352b7c9a58e0419022d96e6ff266f69d826c", "ja": "なるほど。それじゃあ、こういう方法はどうです？", "zh": "原来如此，那这种方法怎么样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_038chz_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_038chz_4007", "source_sha256": "dd698f4265ab926d8593bb3173bcac0e7eecbf0e0a57c0a7f0b7c8c3aa44efc3", "ja": "イメージする", "zh": "想像一下", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_038chz_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_038chz_4008", "source_sha256": "1f251c60ede7b00ddcb1e2a99d7acb0e399b8eb693ca63af2b27283deb66873d", "ja": "イメチェンする", "zh": "改变形象", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_038chz_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_038chz_4009", "source_sha256": "c99570067758b2e3eca0586fbde78150c9b5680711f15697b2dcd90e28ae946a", "ja": "覆面で出る", "zh": "蒙面出场", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_038chz_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_038chz_4100_p", "source_sha256": "0e59cea5e93acba49742ff8a178d38cada95e77dc5924e6699447f6eaa1178a8", "ja": "普段、知り合いの人達と接している時の自分を、\nイメージしてみては？　あくまで、自然な千鶴さんで。", "zh": "要不要试着想像看看，平常和友人\n相处时的自己呢？展现最为自然的千鹤就好。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_038chz_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_038chz_4101_038chz", "source_sha256": "ff6764071a06fef8eb8be1adb233cd71cdd68911ae5ef324a2d3755bfa06d312", "ja": "自然なわたくし……。", "zh": "自然的本小姐……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_038chz_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_038chz_4102_038chz", "source_sha256": "a5dad4c282a29fc86da6a3a81f85e1db05ec55dad1ca9dd4651b9b33af036c9e", "ja": "そう……そうですわね！　誰に見られようとわたくしは\nわたくし。胸を張って、ステージに立ちますわ！", "zh": "就……就是说呢！无论被谁看见，本小姐就是\n本小姐，会抬头挺胸站上舞台的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_038chz_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_038chz_4103_p", "source_sha256": "3919d79262db102b1d3da3d9435632b5e89fb108705b32c1b7babca5edb3d4d4", "ja": "その意気ですよ。\n最高の千鶴さんを見せてあげましょう！", "zh": "这么积极就对了。\n让大家看看最棒的千鹤吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_038chz_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_038chz_4200_p", "source_sha256": "3057bcc58c9c0488f6cef2f2f5e28f09d106a8fb48decefc52e73ce5a4943f53", "ja": "いつもの千鶴さんと、少しイメージを変えて\nいくのはどうでしょう。", "zh": "要不要稍微改变形象，\n尝试平常千鹤不会做的打扮呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_038chz_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_038chz_4201_038chz", "source_sha256": "add1e593290fa96d272c9b03b070487539a9df66989066af23dc1b50d306f3c5", "ja": "イメチェンするんですの？　確かに、それならば\nわたくしとは気づかれないかもしれませんわね……。", "zh": "改变形象吗？的确，这样一来，\n也许就不会有人认出本小姐了呢……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_038chz_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_038chz_4202_038chz", "source_sha256": "61673f04a2a8b002a8a017c51225cf26e2f93c26f4452b5137bf6b539124f023", "ja": "でも、やめておきますわ。よくよく考えてみれば、\nセレブにコソコソする姿は似合いませんものね。", "zh": "但还是别这么做好了。仔细想想，\n偷偷摸摸的模样毕竟还是与名流身分不符呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_038chz_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_038chz_4300_p", "source_sha256": "2d7117f2f116d503413bf069b6281db15554a8e19f93e5a84af3e42e7e3147c0", "ja": "謎の覆面セレブアイドルとして、ステージに\n立つというのは……。", "zh": "要不要以神秘蒙面名流偶像之姿\n站上舞台呢……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_038chz_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_038chz_4301_038chz", "source_sha256": "7bf14b2e51eaed30d79235a70849b4e1ac46540ac99a5661da05f5907ead06f0", "ja": "なるほど！　それなら誰も、\nわたくしとは気づかない……", "zh": "原来如此！这样一来\n就不会有人认出本小姐……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_038chz_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_038chz_4302_038chz", "source_sha256": "002119e0889271bf2b2fc5444084de4e23bf1dd36c3c7e6859b698e9cdb99f77", "ja": "って、貴方、一体何を考えていますの？　覆面では、\nセレブやアイドルどころか、誰かもわかりませんわ！", "zh": "等等，你到底在想什么？要是蒙面了，\n先不提名流或偶像，连本小姐是谁都看不出来了呀！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
